OL,3,GNEWSACourt reserves judgment on retrial
OL,4,Aof woman who killed abusive partner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal has reserved
OL,7,Fjudgment on a bid by prosecutors for
OL,8,Fthe retrial of a woman who stabbed her
OL,9,Fabusive partner to death.
OL,11,FJulie Ann McIlwaine was convicted in
OL,12,F2025 of murdering James Joseph Crossley
OL,13,Fbut had that conviction overturned on
OL,14,Fappeal last month.
OL,16,FShe had admitted killing her partner,
OL,17,Fclaiming to have suffered a temporary
OL,18,Floss of control as a victim of domestic
OL,19,Fabuse.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
